t your speed; misses slow you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mastery:</strong> Ascend 7 original tracks across 3 difficulties to perfect your runs. Compete for the highest altitude on map-specific leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Soundtrack:</strong> Launching with music from indie artists <strong>FEISTLING, Killin’ Void, Ion Diary,</strong> and <strong>funiel</strong>, spanning Drum &amp; Bass, Dubstep, and House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Content:</strong> Includes a fully functional <strong>Beatmap Editor</strong> at launch. Create your own maps with your own music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551890/extras/572720b3c3fbab90f373f7e91ec80a2c.poster.avif?t=1781552749\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551890/extras/572720b3c3fbab90f373f7e91ec80a2c.webm?t=1781552749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551890/extras/572720b3c3fbab90f373f7e91ec80a2c.mp4?t=1781552749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>EARLY ACCESS ROADMAP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb is just beginning. We are committed to delivering frequent updates based on your feedback. Planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Multiplayer:</strong> Climb side-by-side with friends in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Songs:</strong> Even more original songs coming soon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat:</strong> In-game communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charac